<view class="page-shell collection-page"><view class="eyebrow">我的卡册</view><view class="title">留住喜欢的那一张</view><view class="intro">收藏 {{cards.length}} / 50 · 已遇见 {{unlocked}} / 24 张主题卡</view><view class="source-tabs"><button class="source {{source === 'favorites' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="favorites" bindtap="chooseSource">我的收藏</button><button class="source {{source === 'recent' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="recent" bindtap="chooseSource">最近结果</button><button class="source {{source === 'gallery' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="gallery" bindtap="chooseSource">主题图鉴</button></view>
 <block wx:if="{{source !== 'gallery'}}"><scroll-view class="filter-scroll" scroll-x><view class="filters"><button wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="id" style="width:112rpx;margin:0" class="filter {{filter === item.id ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseFilter">{{item.name}}</button></view></scroll-view><view wx:if="{{visible.length}}" class="card-grid"><view wx:for="{{visible}}" wx:key="id" class="mini-card type-{{item.type}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openCard"><view class="mini-type">{{item.type === 'pair' ? '双人星图' : item.type === 'dice' ? '星光骰子' : item.type === 'spread' ? '星光牌阵' : item.type === 'book' ? '答案之书' : item.type === 'quiz' ? '趣味测试' : item.type === 'theme' ? item.themeLabel : item.type === 'daily' ? '每日星座卡' : '今日主签'}}</view><view class="mini-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="mini-keyword">{{item.keyword}}</view><view class="mini-sign">{{item.pair ? item.pair.signA + ' × ' + item.pair.signB : item.sign}} · {{item.date}}</view><view wx:if="{{source === 'favorites'}}" class="remove" role="button" aria-label="取消收藏" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="removeCard">×</view></view></view><view wx:else class="empty"><view>这里还没有卡片</view><view class="empty-note">换一个分类，或去抽一张喜欢的卡。</view><button class="primary-button empty-action" bindtap="openDraw">去抽卡</button></view><view wx:if="{{source === 'recent'}}" class="note">抽签、普通牌阵、双人星图、骰子、书页各保留最近30条，测试最多20条。喜欢的结果可以收藏。</view></block>
 <block wx:else><view class="note">自由抽卡时遇见的主题卡会点亮。重复抽到不增加数量，不代表稀有度或运气。</view><button class="ghost-button" bindtap="openLegacy">继续探索经典主题卡 ↗︎</button><view class="gallery"><view wx:for="{{gallery}}" wx:key="sourceId" class="gallery-card {{item.unlocked ? 'unlocked' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.sourceId}}" bindtap="openGallery"><view class="gallery-top">{{item.unlocked ? '已收录' : '未遇见'}}</view><view class="gallery-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="gallery-label">{{item.label}}</view></view></view></block>
 <view class="note">卡册仅保存在当前设备，清理小程序数据后无法恢复。</view></view>
